==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Paldea Evolved|Tinkatink|102}} from the {{TCG|Paldea Evolved}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Tinkatink}}.
*'''Beat''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|VS|Falkner's Farfetch'd|3}} and {{TCG|VS|Karen's Magmar|88}}, both from the {{TCG|Pokémon VS}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

